 "steps": [
  {
   "caption": "A universal claim has one term per element. On a four-element domain, ∀x P(x) is the conjunction P(a) ∧ P(b) ∧ P(c) ∧ P(d).",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "e0",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "e1",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "e2",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "e3",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Check a: P(a) is true. The claim survives this element.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "e0",
     "set": {
      "tone": "success"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "v0",
     "set": {
      "label": "P(a) = T",
      "tone": "success",
      "fill": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Check b: P(b) is true. Still no counterexample.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "e1",
     "set": {
      "tone": "success"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "v1",
     "set": {
      "label": "P(b) = T",
      "tone": "success",
      "fill": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Check c: P(c) is false. One false term makes the whole AND false: c is a counterexample.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "e2",
     "set": {
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "v2",
     "set": {
      "label": "P(c) = F",
      "tone": "danger",
      "fill": "danger"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "d is true as well, but it no longer matters: a universal needs every element, and c already failed.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "e3",
     "set": {
      "tone": "muted"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "v3",
     "set": {
      "label": "P(d) = T",
      "tone": "muted"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "So ∀x P(x) = T ∧ T ∧ F ∧ T = F. To refute a ∀, one counterexample is enough.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "conj",
     "set": {
      "text": "T ∧ T ∧ F ∧ T = F",
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "verdict",
     "set": {
      "text": "∀x P(x) is false (counterexample c)",
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
